  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative will strengthen child protection systems in four Odisha districts by building capacity of Block- and Panchayat level child protection committees. Developing and enforcing Child Protection Policies in child caring institutions and schools ensuring safer inclusive and sustainable protection for vulnerable children and youth. Providing aftercare for care leavers including career counseling. Environmental awareness  session in child care institutions will take place.</narrative>
